    "UI_LugliAch_opt_unlocksound_tip": "On by default. Plays a short chime alongside the notice in the corner. The backfill that runs when a world loads stays silent either way, so a character who already qualified for a dozen achievements does not arrive to a dozen chimes. Takes effect immediately",
